<title>FINLAND: NESTE, GAZPROM TO SET UP NATURAL GAS J/V.</title>
<headline>NESTE, GAZPROM TO SET UP NATURAL GAS J/V.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish oil and energy group Neste Oy said in a statement on Friday it had agreed with Russian natural gas group RAO Gazprom to set up a joint venture to implement a north European gas pipeline project.  </p>
<p>&quot;The northern Europe gas pipeline project is based on increasing natural gas exports from Russia to Europe,&quot; Neste said, but gave no figures.</p>
<p>Planning and research would start this year, it said, adding the intention was to implement the project by the year 2005.</p>
<p>Neste gave no further details.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
